   "modifications": [
    "Read the encounter groups as an undirected weighted graph, summing shared groups across the novel.",
    "Collapsed Hugo's chapter tags to the five volumes, so a segment is a tome.",
    "Dropped redacted and numbered-anonymous figures (G--, Old woman 1) who cannot be guessed.",
    "Dropped ties weaker than 1 and characters with fewer than 2 ties, then kept the largest connected component (69 nodes and 241 ties in, 54 and 226 out).",
